  "title": "Olmstead’s Seven Imposing in $59,400 Northlands Futurity Thursday at Canterbury Park",
  "summary": "Quarter Horse trainer Jason Olmstead will saddle seven 2-year-olds, including the five fastest qualifiers, in the $59,400 Northlands Futurity Thursday at Canterbury Park. The Northlands is the co-feature along with the $36,675 Canterbury Park Quarter Horse Derby in which Olmstead is favored with Uncle Redheads, one of his four qualifiers in the 400 yard race. […]",
